WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.529
A training engine

00:00:01.341 --> 00:00:02.059
for your local

00:00:01.871 --> 00:00:02.484
model

00:00:03.006 --> 00:00:03.949
Songe is a

00:00:03.761 --> 00:00:05.022
training engine that

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:05.659
lets you train

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:06.732
local models using

00:00:06.579 --> 00:00:07.569
idle compute

00:00:07.708 --> 00:00:09.170
Learning new conversations

00:00:08.982 --> 00:00:10.043
starts when idle

00:00:10.582 --> 00:00:11.490
While you work

00:00:11.573 --> 00:00:12.810
Songe notices what

00:00:12.622 --> 00:00:13.765
happens after each

00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:14.296
of the model's

00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:14.791
actions

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:15.935
the tool result

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:16.879
the error your

00:00:16.691 --> 00:00:17.669
next message

00:00:18.206 --> 00:00:19.361
Agent opencode

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.906
Songe models default

00:00:20.718 --> 00:00:22.274
granite-4 .

00:00:22.086 --> 00:00:24.904
2-3b-MLX-4bit

00:00:25.043 --> 00:00:25.880
When your agent

00:00:25.691 --> 00:00:26.505
is quiet

00:00:26.717 --> 00:00:27.578
it teaches the

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:28.262
model to see

00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:28.922
those coming

00:00:29.064 --> 00:00:29.641
You need a

00:00:29.453 --> 00:00:30.903
model served locally

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.870
and an agent

00:00:31.989 --> 00:00:33.085
Machines without a

00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:34.288
GPU still serve

00:00:34.111 --> 00:00:34.913
and record

00:00:34.937 --> 00:00:35.644
but do not

00:00:35.456 --> 00:00:36.115
train

